  m_Text: "When the final blow was dealt to the werewolf, the darkness began to dissipate.
    The dungeon shook, not from the monster's wrath, but from the ancient curse disappearing
    with it. The enemy's body lost its strength and crumbled to ashes, as if it had
    never existed.\n\nThe captive companion appeared before the player, exhausted
    but alive. They met each other's gaze, and there was no need for words: each
    understood that their bond was stronger than any evil.\n\nThe cave was illuminated
    by a soft glow \u2014 what had been a gloomy dungeon a minute ago now resembled
    a temple where even the stones radiated peace. The exit opened by itself.\n\nClimbing
    to the surface, Ara and Grus breathed in the fresh air again. Before them lay
    dawn \u2014 the first after long nights in darkness. Both realized that what
    they had experienced had changed them forever: now they were not just travelers
    who helped people, but those who were capable of overcoming even ancient evil.\n\nTheir
    journey continues \u2014 but now together, without fear of losing each other."
